        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Success</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb from zero to the top of success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, study, start businesses, invest, and compete with others to build your dream life in a unique clicker game about the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success: is a desktop incremental game where every click brings you closer to your next goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from nothing — get your first job, open your first business, invest in stocks and bonds, and manage your time and resources to achieve true financial freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏢 Work — earn money by working multiple jobs at once. Manage your energy and plan your day efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💻 Freelance — work on flexible projects, earn extra income, and build your independent career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 Business — invest in startups, upgrade your ventures, and watch your profit grow — or lose part of your investment if the market turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌐 Illegal Business — take the dark path to wealth. Build an illegal empire, but beware of the risks and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Money Laundering — convert your dirty money into clean assets through sophisticated laundering operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Crimes — commit crimes for quick cash, but remember: the higher the reward, the greater the risk of getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚 Education — take courses, develop new skills, and unlock advanced professions and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Stocks — trade on the stock market, analyze trends, and build your portfolio with dynamic price charts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Crypto Mining — set up mining rigs, mine cryptocurrencies, and watch real-time price charts to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏛️ Bonds — buy government bonds with different yields and maturities to secure long-term passive income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏘️ Real Estate — invest in properties, collect rental income, and build a real estate empire for steady cash flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛏️ Land Mining — purchase land plots, extract valuable resources, and upgrade your equipment to increase mining efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏦 Bank — take loans or make deposits. Manage your assets like a true financial strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛋️ Property — buy items and assets that restore energy and improve your quality of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Lottery — take a risk and try your luck with tickets of different rarity and chances to win big!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Energy &amp; Health — balance between studying, working, resting, and entertainment to stay productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛌 Rest — recover your energy and health through various relaxation activities to maintain peak performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💊 Habits — develop positive habits that boost your stats and unlock new opportunities over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 Competition — grow your wealth and compete with virtual players who also build their fortunes. Can you become the richest among them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 The Path to Success — from a broke dreamer to a millionaire investor and business magnate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Who is this game for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Fans of clickers and incremental games who enjoy steady progress and smart management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Players who love economy, investment, and life simulation mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Those who want to relax but still feel a sense of growth and accomplishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Anyone who believes that success is built one step — or one click — at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Success</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb from zero to the top of success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, study, start businesses, invest, and compete with others to build your dream life in a unique clicker game about the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success: is a desktop incremental game where every click brings you closer to your next goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from nothing — get your first job, open your first business, invest in stocks and bonds, and manage your time and resources to achieve true financial freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏢 Work — earn money by working multiple jobs at once. Manage your energy and plan your day efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💻 Freelance — work on flexible projects, earn extra income, and build your independent career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 Business — invest in startups, upgrade your ventures, and watch your profit grow — or lose part of your investment if the market turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌐 Illegal Business — take the dark path to wealth. Build an illegal empire, but beware of the risks and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Money Laundering — convert your dirty money into clean assets through sophisticated laundering operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Crimes — commit crimes for quick cash, but remember: the higher the reward, the greater the risk of getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚 Education — take courses, develop new skills, and unlock advanced professions and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Stocks — trade on the stock market, analyze trends, and build your portfolio with dynamic price charts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Crypto Mining — set up mining rigs, mine cryptocurrencies, and watch real-time price charts to maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏛️ Bonds — buy government bonds with different yields and maturities to secure long-term passive income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏘️ Real Estate — invest in properties, collect rental income, and build a real estate empire for steady cash flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛏️ Land Mining — purchase land plots, extract valuable resources, and upgrade your equipment to increase mining efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏦 Bank — take loans or make deposits. Manage your assets like a true financial strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛋️ Property — buy items and assets that restore energy and improve your quality of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Lottery — take a risk and try your luck with tickets of different rarity and chances to win big!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Energy &amp; Health — balance between studying, working, resting, and entertainment to stay productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛌 Rest — recover your energy and health through various relaxation activities to maintain peak performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💊 Habits — develop positive habits that boost your stats and unlock new opportunities over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 Competition — grow your wealth and compete with virtual players who also build their fortunes. Can you become the richest among them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 The Path to Success — from a broke dreamer to a millionaire investor and business magnate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Who is this game for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Fans of clickers and incremental games who enjoy steady progress and smart management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Players who love economy, investment, and life simulation mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Those who want to relax but still feel a sense of growth and accomplishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Anyone who believes that success is built one step — or one click — at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
